# Runtime output directory. Everything written here is git-ignored:
#   chroma/                 persistent ChromaDB store (both collections)
#   calibration.json        measured similarity threshold (scripts/calibrate_threshold.py)
#   index_state.json        knowledge-base version + index statistics
#   requests.jsonl          JSON-Lines request log
# Committed, human-readable reports are written to ../../reports/ instead.


